# CLAUDE.md — metashrew

> Drop this file at the root of `metashrew` to pull in the subfrost-ops domain pack.

The WASM-powered Bitcoin indexing framework. Runtime + storage + sync engine. Indexers (like `alkanes-rs`) plug in as WASM modules.

## Pre-work skills to load
- `alkanes-onboarding` — context for downstream indexers
- `metashrew-indexer-patterns` — host functions, `_start`, view fns, RMW hazard
- `wasm-build-pipeline` — module size, allocator, panic handler

## Reviewers to invoke
- `metashrew-indexer-reviewer` for runtime ABI changes
- `wasm-contract-auditor` for any indexer module touching the host import surface
- `rust-reviewer` (built-in) for general Rust hygiene

## Rules pack
- `rules/alkanes/*` (testing.md has reorg-test requirements)
- `rules/rust/*`
- `rules/common/*`

## Key files
- SPECIFICATION.md — runtime ABI contract
- `crates/metashrew-runtime/src/runtime.rs` — `MetashrewRuntime`
- `crates/metashrew-runtime/src/smt.rs` — SMT state commitment
- `crates/rockshrew-sync/src/sync.rs` — sync + reorg
- `crates/rockshrew-mono/src/main.rs` — integrated server

